{"failure_id":"FAIL-55d81817","timestamp":"2026-07-28T15:29:54.826210Z","category":"runtime","severity":"high","error_message":"S38 error-retry loop: 0-token 'Request failed \u2014 please retry.' turns classified transient \u2192 ~60-message spam storm on a poisoned context (2026-07-28 incident)","root_cause":"classifyError mapped stopReason 'error' + usage 0 tokens to 'transient' (per-burst max 5); errorRetryCount reset to 0 on each turn_start so every burst started fresh; consecutiveErrors needed >10 to open the circuit breaker; no session-global cap bounded total nudges; no in-flight nudge dedup (every error turn_end fired its own nudge via safeSendUserMessage); errorRetryUntil was documented as non-gating; no poisoned-context detection (0-token 'Request failed' was treated as retryable). Result: ~9 nudge bursts (~60 context-bloating messages) before the circuit opened. A later compaction preserved the failure transcript, and every subsequent request still failed \u2014 a POISONED CONTEXT \u2014 while the nudge loop kept firing.","status":"resolved","affected_files":["extensions/mega-events/error-classifier.ts","extensions/mega-events/agent-handlers.ts","extensions/mega-config.ts","extensions/mega-compact.ts","extensions/mega-runtime/helpers.ts","extensions/mega-runtime/runtime.ts"],"regression_pattern":"errorRetryCount\\s*=\\s*0\\s*;\\s*//\\s*.*turn_start|stopReason.*error.*->.*transient|errorRetryUntil.*non-gating|request failed.*->.*transient","prevention_rule":"S38 retry nudges are bounded by three independent layers: (R1) in-flight dedup via retryNudgePending \u2014 one queued nudge per new agent turn \u2014 plus gating errorRetryBackoffMs via errorRetryUntil; (R2) session-global cap errorRetrySessionMax (default 3) \u2014 total nudges per session across all bursts, terminal when hit; (R3) poisoned-context detection \u2014 0-token 'error' with usage present {0,0}, generic 'request failed', 400 non-overflow (orphaned tool result / malformed / unexpected role 